        "subject": "LU-19681 tests: skip sanity-lnet 227 on old routers",
        "message": "LU-19681 tests: skip sanity-lnet 227 on old routers\n\nRouter peer health, which makes a router drop messages for a\ndown peer NI, was fixed by LU-17855 and is not in releases older\nthan 2.15.64. Against b2_15 servers, which act as the routers in\ninterop testing, test_227 always fails with \"Expected dropped > 0\nfound 0\". Skip it when the servers predate that fix.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I0f5cc8f3655fd4702990712b5fff310496c0cc86\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
